{
 "about": "Copilot eval set. Synthetic projects only; `focus` is the question open on the questionnaire page (scripts/eval_copilot.py seeds them). {name} in a message is replaced with a seeded id; in a pattern, with the figure the platform's own report gives. Checks: has_chart (a chart was drawn), table_mentions (the tables shown under the reply), tools (all must run), tools_any (one must), no_tools, cards (exact kinds), cards_allowed (no others), card_mentions, mentions, avoids (regex, case-insensitive). Every turn also fails if it states figures without a lookup, unless may_skip_tools.",
